# What `gcloud run deploy --source backend` uploads to Cloud Build (plan 006).
# Same exclusions as .dockerignore: build output, local uploads and the test project
# (HourOffice.Tests/bin alone is ~0.5 GB) never leave this machine.
.gcloudignore
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/uploads/
HourOffice.Tests/
*.user
.vs/
